$DIR/main.p:8:3: expected '}', found 'EOF'
    The file ended while a block was still open. The { on line 5 has no matching
    }, so the parser reached the end of the file looking for it. Add the missing
    } where the block should end; the mistake is somewhere between line 5 and
    the end of the file.
